	(descr "SPARX six-port receiver die (1.05 x 1.35 x 0.2 mm, IHP SG13CMOS) glued with conductive epoxy on a ground land and gold ball bonded. One finger row: OUT and VDD next to the die, REF fanned out, VSS bonded down onto land tongues. Fingers 0.125 mm, closest gap 0.135 mm. LO and RF GSG pads (125 um pitch) are probed, not bonded.")
